# ALLOWLIST, NOT A BLOCKLIST.
#
# Everything is ignored by default and the four public files are named back
# in. A blocklist has to anticipate every engine file that might be copied
# here, and the first version of this one listed twenty-five of them by name
# — which told a reader the engine's module layout while trying to protect
# it. Naming what is public leaks nothing; naming what is private leaks the
# shape of it.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!RECEIPTS_API.md
!LICENSE
!DATA-LICENSE.md
!verify_ledger.py
